    "transcript": "What does return to home do if I lose the radio link?",
    "turn_id": "ba50d01f7396-001",
    "response": "If the radio link is lost, the drone will automatically trigger the return\u2011to\u2011home (RTH) mode. It uses its GPS and onboard navigation to fly back to the launch point, following the pre\u2011set flight path and altitude. If GPS is weak, it will descend to a safe altitude and hover until the link is restored or it lands.",
